        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uvuti vwa avandu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lwi kiguru choosi chaadukaa muliru kandi nimuhulira mwoyo nigutura mu kisundi, ahene yaho kandi aviimiliri vi zihiiri zienyu vaza ku inzi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nivavoora, ‘Yahova Nyasaye wiitu yakumanyia ovonene vwivwe novukumi vwivwe, lwa kwamuhulira namolomaa kutura hagati humuliru! Kalunu kumali kulola ndi mundu anyala kuzizagilira komenya, kali niiva Nyasaye umali komoloma naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa kigira ki kwiviiki mu vuhimwa vwi likuza kandi? Muliru gwukutihiza ligali yigu gulakudiviza. Koveeye nagiligali ndi kulakuza nikuva nikuhulira mwoyo gwa Yahova Nyasaye wiitu namolomaa kandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mundu ki uwamanya alava mwoyo niyakamara kuhulira Nyasaye oveeye mwoyo namolomaa kutura hagati hu muliru, kuli kunyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa, yirana uzie yo kandi uhuliri goosi ga Yahova Nyasaye wiitu avoora. Maku wirane yinu okovolere goosi aga Yahova Nyasaye wiitu akovoleraa. Kulahulira nukugalinda.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lwa Yahova yahulira yaga, yambolera, ‘Mali kuhulira makuva ga avandu yava vakovoleye kandi gaveeye giligali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oh, vwakaveeye vulahi niiva vakaveeye nu mwoyo kuli yigu kazozo gwu kutia Inzi. Vwakaveeye vulahi niiva vakahaani ku Inzi luyali nokuhulira malago gange goosi kazozo, kunangwa vindu viosi viakaveeye vilahi kuvo kandi ku visukululwi viavo mihiga ni mihiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zia, uvavoolere viirane mu mahema gaavo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa ivi, Musa, utigale hano harara ninzi, na Inzi ndakuha malago gange goosi, namalagano. Wigizi avandu malago yaga kunangwa vaduuki kugalonda mu kivala cha mbahezaa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
